| # | Metric / 指标 | Formula / 代入公式 | Result / 结果 |
|---|---------------|-------------------|---------------|
| 1 | Total Plaintext / 总明文 | `sum(plaintext_size) = 1370210000` | 1306.73 MB |
| 2 | Total Ciphertext / 总密文 | `sum(ciphertext_size) = 13755962039` | 13118.71 MB |
| 3 | Total CT Blocks (Upload) / 总密文上传块 | `sum(num_ciphertexts) = 41150` | 41150 blocks |
| 4 | Total Aggregated CTs (Download) / 总聚合密文 | `sum(aggregated_ciphertexts) = 3292` | 3292 blocks |
| 5 | Avg Single CT Size / 平均单密文大小 | `13755962039/41150 = 334288` | 326.45 KB |
| 6 | Avg Aggregated CT Size / 平均聚合密文大小 | `xMKCKKS.compute_aggregated_ct_size(32)` | 28932.08 KB |
| 7 | Total Upload / 总上传 | `sum(upload_cost) = 974287656639` | 929153.11 MB |
